  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "type": "HOOK",
      "narration": "Your AI agent just gave a customer the wrong refund policy. Confidently. Here's why, and the fix.",
      "durationFrames": 220,
      "timingSource": "estimated",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "data": {
        "headline": "CONFIDENT. INSTANT. WRONG.",
        "subtext": "why agents make things up",
        "heroAsset": "lucide:bot",
        "headlineAtWord": 1,
        "heroAtWord": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "type": "CHAT_MOCKUP",
      "narration": "Ask an ungrounded agent about your refund window. It says thirty days. Your actual policy file, which it never opened, says fourteen.",
      "durationFrames": 300,
      "timingSource": "estimated",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "data": {
        "headline": "Confident, instant \u2014 [and wrong.]",
        "headlineColor": "red",
        "panelLabel": "AI AGENT",
        "panelColor": "purple",
        "messages": [
          {
            "from": "user",
            "text": "What's our refund window?",
            "atWord": 4
          },
          {
            "from": "agent",
            "text": "About [30 days], I think.",
            "color": "red",
            "atWord": 10
          }
        ],
        "sideCard": {
          "kicker": "NEVER OPENED",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "refund-policy.md"
            },
            {
              "text": "refund_window: 14 days",
              "color": "blue"
            }
          ],
          "atWord": 15
        },
        "source": "AN UNGROUNDED AGENT ANSWERS FROM TRAINING \u2014 NOT FROM YOUR FACTS"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "type": "STEP_FLOW",
      "narration": "The fix everyone reaches for is RAG. Your docs get split into chunks, embedded as vectors, and stored in a vector database searched by meaning.",
      "durationFrames": 320,
      "timingSource": "estimated",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "data": {
        "headline": "The fix everyone reached for: [RAG.]",
        "headlineColor": "blue",
        "steps": [
          {
            "kicker": "STEP 1",
            "title": "DOCS",
            "sub": "everything you own",
            "atWord": 8
          },
          {
            "kicker": "STEP 2",
            "title": "CHUNKS",
            "sub": "split into pieces",
            "atWord": 13
          },
          {
            "kicker": "STEP 3",
            "title": "VECTORS",
            "sub": "embedded as numbers",
            "atWord": 16
          },
          {
            "kicker": "STEP 4",
            "title": "VECTOR DB",
            "sub": "searched by meaning",
            "color": "blue",
            "atWord": 21
          }
        ],
        "caption": {
          "text": "ask \u2192 pull closest \u2192 answer",
          "color": "orange",
          "atWord": 24
        },
        "source": "RETRIEVAL-AUGMENTED GENERATION \u2014 THE STANDARD KNOWLEDGE PIPELINE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "type": "STAT_PANELS",
      "narration": "And no, you can't just dump everything into a one million token context. Answer quality degrades, and you burn many times the tokens. Selective retrieval wins.",
      "durationFrames": 330,
      "timingSource": "estimated",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "data": {
        "headline": "Myth: [\u201cjust use 1M context.\u201d]",
        "headlineColor": "red",
        "gridVisual": {
          "kicker": "CONTEXT WINDOW \u00b7 1M",
          "legendA": "mostly irrelevant",
          "legendB": "relevant",
          "atWord": 8
        },
        "stats": [
          {
            "kicker": "ANSWER QUALITY",
            "value": "\u2193 degraded",
            "color": "red",
            "atWord": 16
          },
          {
            "kicker": "TOKEN COST",
            "value": "18\u00d7",
            "note": "burned",
            "color": "yellow",
            "atWord": 21
          }
        ],
        "verdict": {
          "text": "selective, routed retrieval wins",
          "color": "green",
          "atWord": 25
        },
        "source": "IRRELEVANT CONTEXT DEGRADES THE ANSWER AND BURNS TOKENS"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "type": "QUOTE_SPOTLIGHT",
      "narration": "As one staff engineer put it: context you engineer by hand, a wiki the model reads, matters as much as the model itself.",
      "durationFrames": 280,
      "timingSource": "estimated",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "data": {
        "headline": "Grounding is [engineering], not magic.",
        "headlineColor": "blue",
